{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>發佈時間：17:45 2026-08-19 HKT</p>\n\n<p>今日七夕節，內地頂流男神肖戰以護膚品牌全球代言人身份到尖沙咀出席活動。雖然活動於下午五時開始在品牌快閃店出現，但一早已聚集近萬名「小飛俠」（粉絲暱稱）陷入瘋狂。</p>\n<h2>通往商場地鐵站出口實施分流措施</h2>\n<p>粉絲更逼爆商場的5層樓及場外，就連通往商場的港鐵站出口，早於下午二時已實施分流政策，行人進入商場必須繞路行，認真誇張。</p>\n<img alt=\"內地頂流男神肖戰好靚仔。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cac979beb8f70bc22947b96b5c37fe4c/2026-08/01b.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"古裝扮相都迷人。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/76df552c9fa3e27f4494815182a84e46/2026-08/23_1_0.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲紅海應援攻陷尖沙咀。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/74ba5d26e662ba26df9e6f8d0cef48a1/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_43_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"拉起應援物。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/8a78384a18ebd4bd43689d98b53d3a9e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_43.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"熱情粉絲更升溫。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/644da21f859888be8e63e388fdc6006e/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_44_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"Fan唔怕熱。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4701381a27f07bbb9990e407460b22db/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_44.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲萬人空巷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/bdb5ed35f15a78b29440da2505ebb8cb/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_45.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"場內都係人潮。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/cdb7566fcd0e3a0e589f2bfca3304759/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_17_05_13.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"出動警方維持秩序。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/4190187352ecc8f0cb0c62fa37240727/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_15_56_53.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"每個通道都有粉絲。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/432b3dcca85c47a55559a6fc7d51aa49/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_15_56_54_2_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"粉絲早已霸好有利位置。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/1985ef9d15c1f16f4e8ae788619c08bf/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_15_56_54_3_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"在圍欄內安靜等候偶像。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/c4849252653728510bbda6f33bc9069d/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_15_56_55_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"有些累到席地而坐。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/af0b3ec4cc23e80eb4ded8189c6db8c2/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_15_56_56_1_.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"場外環境。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/312abb62097d990c56e733683d5441b8/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_42.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"逼爆五層商場。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/422b2ade08d7f0345ef207baa9d8bf32/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_40_47.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"場內被攻陷。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/6a85906c6d4ebb672b5e2e3a6fc75617/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_17_05_13_0.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"出動大批警員。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/eb2937c2b0d37bb65c29c5a2428e2130/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_17_05_19.jpeg\"/>\n<img alt=\"品牌公關見狀表明沒有邀請香港傳媒到場採訪，並即時驅趕離開。\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/lr/sthl/a6a62163ee2861e2ca966c53f217e35f/2026-08/WhatsApp_Image_2026-08-19_at_16_47_12_0.jpg\"/>\n<h2>肖戰粉絲晨早六時霸位守候</h2>\n<p>商場內外人頭湧湧，萬人空巷，商場附近的星光大道匯聚上千名粉絲，大批粉絲晨早上六時已到場霸定靚位守候場偶像，現場所見警方於入口位駕起鐵欄，亦有多名警員維持秩序，還有警車在場戒備，並未有混亂情況出現。</p>\n<h2>肖戰粉絲拉橫額高喊偶像名字</h2>\n<p>在場粉絲見記者拍攝，更齊齊拉橫額應援高叫偶像「肖戰」名字，但公關見狀表明沒有邀請香港傳媒到場採訪，並即時驅趕離開。<br/> </p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-19T10:07:40.123689+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":366,"images":18,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none"}}